 # CLAUDE.md — RougeHalla (package name `raid-br`)
 
-Top-down 2.5D roguelike battle arena. Up to 8 players pick a faction, loot, farm mobs and fight. The last one standing wins Glorious Victory (GV, cosmetics-only). Phaser 4 client, Colyseus 0.18 authoritative server, npm workspaces monorepo. Colored shapes only. Design and numbers: `docs/GAME_DESIGN.md`. Running and playing: `README.md`. Faction ids are `fire`, `sentenced`, `plague`, `frost`, `holy` (shown to players as Demon Blood). Weapon ids are `sword`, `bow`, `wand`, `shield`, `axe`. The roguelike overhaul (zones, typed camps, contested chests, skills, relics) is planned in `docs/ROGUELIKE_PLAN.md`; built so far: R0 (contracts), R3 (the planning phase and screen), R4a (the per-mob-type buffs and mono-type camps) and R5 (the camp runtime: camp-wide aggro, a contested shared skill chest per cleared camp, 21 passives, the training room's practice console), all on today's wedge maps. Zone maps, active skills, relics, the buffs' on-hit statuses (R4b) and boons are not built (the rules below say which). Each faction's Wish (`D`: `freeze`, `swarm`, `trial`, `blaze`, `lastStand`; GAME_DESIGN 8.8) and the status runtime and ability framework under it (8.9) are built.
