+
+Each arena run has **ten standing quest offers**: five known during planning and five rumoured. They ask you to kill mobs or a player, collect tokens, or carry a parcel back from a far zone. There is no accept button. Finish the objective and stand by its giver to turn it in automatically; the first player to do so closes it for everyone. Givers are neutral and immune to attacks and Wishes, so they are turn-in points, not enemies. Every offer has its own fixed expiry.
